17] [17592186552493 #edb/ref 1071 "What is the equation of the *horizontal* asymptote of the function $y=-\\frac{1}{x}?$\n\n$y=$\n{{field-1}}" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552493 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "b45e817e-9efe-5710-bdbb-65f233f4a487" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552493 #edb/ref 1074 "First, let's sketch the graph of $y=-\\frac{1}{x}.$\n\n![](images/40/400dad20519cecf16db43999fd18787643040023135f9e45b0b9f81a98d3717f.png)\n\nNotice that $y\\to 0$ as $x\\to \\infty .$ Therefore, the equation of the horizontal asymptote is $y=0.$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186552356 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1069 "q-113233" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/82/82adb0c829183451723d0fb4d148f51d5e68b1618faafec9ad5ffb2f4d48682f.png)\n\nWhich of the curves shown above is a graph of $y=\\frac{1}{x}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "d366ac0b-5786-5e43-9ba3-867d55d183c7" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552509 #edb/ref 1074 "The graph of $y=\\frac{1}{x}$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/ff/ffd98b8f9b6c7a9260f43772f9c654901bd02c21efa1eb06f2a5fdad8b263729.png)\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"IV only.\"" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1068 #edb/ref 17592186552346 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1069 "q-74360" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1071 "![](images/5e/5e2c5dd5ca5c904ec49a33af3adf9940b400d9f4034ef91b9c7890797da8ba49.png)\n\nWhich of the curves shown above is a graph of $y=-\\frac{1}{x}?$" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1072 #uuid "ede3a9d5-128f-518f-842a-1a283c9a8dd9" #edb/ref 17592186045417] [17592186552520 #edb/ref 1074 "The graph of $y=-\\frac{1}{x}$ is shown below.\n\n![](images/e3/e3f5ed500c81d09e2775f09fd10a22